{"3433430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boo! Hunt", "steam_appid": 3433430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Boo Hunt</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love <strong>Halloween</strong> and miss the nostalgic feeling of <strong>score-competitive arcade</strong> shooters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Boo Hunt</i></strong> just got its <strong>biggest update yet!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Maps. 3 Bosses. 3 Game Modes. Traps everywhere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>Witchwood</strong> — a dark cursed forest crawling with glowing creatures. Brave <strong>The Frozenlands</strong> — an icy wasteland where the cold slows everything down. Survive <strong>Brimstone Hollow</strong> — a hellish inferno where lava pools and fire traps will finish what the demons started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Traps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is packed with traps you can <strong>trigger by shooting</strong> — slow down enemies, speed up your escape, or catch a crowd in a deadly snare. Use them wisely or get caught in your own trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has its own <strong>boss</strong> — powerful, unique creatures that demand more than just spraying bullets. Learn their patterns, hit their weak points, and take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game Modes — 3 Separate Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> The original wave shooter. Survive as long as you can and climb the global scoreboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode:</strong> Race against the clock. Every kill counts — every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Complete unique objectives across waves. The harder you push, the higher you score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has its <strong>own global leaderboard</strong> — grind your rank separately in every mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for upgrades that give you <i>speed, score, jumping bonuses, and extra health</i> right when you feel like <strong>everything is over!</strong> As well as <u>powerful weapons</u> that help you break through the crowds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with your friends</strong> across the globe and see just how good you are at hunting with your Halloween spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel like Boo Hunt is <i>missing something?</i> <u>We hear you!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback is important for us to improve your experience. Purchasing the game shows your support and helps us bring updates — big and small — for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the hunt. Pick your mode. Top the leaderboard.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Boo Hunt</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love <strong>Halloween</strong> and miss the nostalgic feeling of <strong>score-competitive arcade</strong> shooters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Boo Hunt</i></strong> just got its <strong>biggest update yet!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Maps. 3 Bosses. 3 Game Modes. Traps everywhere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>Witchwood</strong> — a dark cursed forest crawling with glowing creatures. Brave <strong>The Frozenlands</strong> — an icy wasteland where the cold slows everything down. Survive <strong>Brimstone Hollow</strong> — a hellish inferno where lava pools and fire traps will finish what the demons started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Traps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is packed with traps you can <strong>trigger by shooting</strong> — slow down enemies, speed up your escape, or catch a crowd in a deadly snare. Use them wisely or get caught in your own trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/98095aac4e7bf89a4bb44cced86d8ab6.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has its own <strong>boss</strong> — powerful, unique creatures that demand more than just spraying bullets. Learn their patterns, hit their weak points, and take them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Game Modes — 3 Separate Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode:</strong> The original wave shooter. Survive as long as you can and climb the global scoreboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode:</strong> Race against the clock. Every kill counts — every second matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Complete unique objectives across waves. The harder you push, the higher you score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has its <strong>own global leaderboard</strong> — grind your rank separately in every mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/942bf28e631fdf0d4255e6c26f3bdfac.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for upgrades that give you <i>speed, score, jumping bonuses, and extra health</i> right when you feel like <strong>everything is over!</strong> As well as <u>powerful weapons</u> that help you break through the crowds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with your friends</strong> across the globe and see just how good you are at hunting with your Halloween spirit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.poster.avif?t=1782575822\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.webm?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/extras/cc7c9d684d8f5e885096d01969e7f8c8.mp4?t=1782575822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel like Boo Hunt is <i>missing something?</i> <u>We hear you!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback is important for us to improve your experience. Purchasing the game shows your support and helps us bring updates — big and small — for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the hunt. Pick your mode. Top the leaderboard.</p>", "short_description": "Boo Hunt is a Halloween-themed arcade wave shooter with 3 maps, 3 bosses, 3 game modes and interactive traps. Survive waves of spooky creatures across Witchwood, The Frozenlands and Brimstone Hollow! Compete on separate global leaderboards in Classic, Time Attack and Challenge modes!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/8316d734d7ec030ee7721c00be9ef421dd4fd3d1/header.jpg?t=1782575822", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/019c68997f12e8624eae64e93f5875ec79b648f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782575822", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433430/019c68997f12e8624eae64e93f5875ec79b648f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782575822", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 3700U - Core i7-8750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX VEGA 10 APU - NVIDIA GeForce MX230<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> In